# SQL

This folder contains SQL scripts used for analyzing the E-commerce Sales dataset.

## File Included

### Ecommerce_Data_Analysis.sql

This SQL script includes:

- Database selection
- Data exploration
- Data quality checks
- Aggregate functions
- GROUP BY and HAVING
- Business KPI analysis
- Date functions
- Window functions (RANK, DENSE_RANK, ROW_NUMBER)
- Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
- Customer, Product, Category, and Region analysis

## Skills Demonstrated

- SQL Queries
- Data Analysis
- Data Cleaning
- Aggregate Functions
- Window Functions
- CTEs
- Business Intelligence
